==English==
===Etymology===
From an alteration of ''rascallion'', a fanciful elaboration of [[rascal]] (someone who is naughty).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɹæpˈskæljən/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[rascal]], [[scamp]], [[rogue]] or [[scoundrel]].

